# Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) and fill in the values from your
# Supabase project (Project Settings -> API). Only these two PUBLIC values ever
# reach the browser — that is safe by design: Row Level Security, not secrecy of
# these values, is what protects your data. NEVER put the service_role key here.
#
# Leaving these unset is fine: every game still runs in local single-device mode,
# it just won't offer "Host / Join from other devices".

VITE_SUPABASE_URL= 
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
